v>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Pink Cotton Candy Tree</b> spawns on the <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay Island</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>. They are worth more than their counterpart, the <a href=\"/wiki/Cotton_Candy_Tree\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cotton Candy Tree\">Blue Cotton Candy Tree</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Textures\">Textures</span></h2>\n<p>The various textures of the Pink Cotton Candy Tree in its raw, sanded, and planked states.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Cotton Candy trees are very light and are smaller at the base.</li>\n<li>Although hard to see, the logs have a cardboard texture to mimic a cotton candy stick.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163507\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 68/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 28/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019505/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.810      1 Template:Wood\n100.00%   36.810      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4806-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163507 and revision id 21000. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Trees","Limited","Events"],"links":[{"title":"Cotton Candy Tree","exists":true},{"title"